sequenceDiagram
    actor Instructor
    participant A3P as student .a3p
    participant Parser as ZipArchive + program.xml parser
    participant AST as Program AST
    participant Grade as eatme-assets grade_* pipeline
    participant Score as quality_scoring
    participant Report as GradingReport

    Instructor->>A3P: collect saved project
    Instructor->>Parser: load .a3p
    Parser->>Parser: unzip program.xml
    Parser->>AST: extract Procedure / Statement nodes
    AST->>Grade: lesson-specific grading input
    Grade->>Score: compute quality scores
    Score-->>Grade: QualityScore[]
    Grade-->>Report: pass/block statuses
    Report-->>Instructor: grading JSON + feedback
